  dialogue:
  - What are the fish I caught doing out here?
  - They began dyin' soon after ye brought 'em to the island.
  - Did you keep them in water?
  - Shut up and listen, lad.
  - "They started rotting immediately after. No time to butcher 'em all.\r"
  - Ye have te go out again.
  - I'm not here to fish, sir. In fact, I would rather limit my time out there on
    the ocean.
  - You should know this already. Are you trying to fuck with me, sir?
  - Watch yer tongue, lad!
  - Ye better be grateful ye even git this opportunity.
  - Now git fishin'!
